{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29243","headline":"奉命和後池十韵 · 许浑","name":"奉命和後池十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"叠石通溪水，量波失旧规。\n芳洲还屈曲，朱阁更逶迤。\n浴鸟翻荷叶，惊蝉出柳丝。\n翠烟秋桧耸，红露晓莲披。\n攀槛登楼近，停桡待客迟。\n野桥从浪没，轻舸信风移。\n竹韵迁棊局，松阴递酒巵。\n性闲鸥自识，心远鹤先知。\n应想秦人会，休怀越相祠。\n当期穆天子，箫鼓宴瑶池。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29243.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29243","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}